# First Reply Bootstrap (Hard)

**Priority:** This file is the short reminder. The full contract lives in **`.cursor/rules/session-bootstrap-enforcer.mdc`**.

- In every NEW chat, the first assistant line must be exactly `Session bootstrap:`.
- Nothing may appear before that line.
- The visible Karpathy echo block is still mandatory on every first reply, including `ping`.
- If pre-load is absent and the first user message already requests substantive code work, follow the fallback described in `.cursor/rules/session-bootstrap-enforcer.mdc`.
- For later substantive coding turns, follow `.cursor/rules/dex-coding-skills-gate.mdc`.
